  "title": "The macro supervenes on the micro but can supersede it",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "26159306-9447-4a8a-ba90-49428109c5cb",
      "text": "A macro level is fixed by its micro level, yet it can do more causal work than the micro. Supervenience does not imply that the micro does all the causation.",
